	(text "LLC half-bridge, fixed fs = 95 kHz"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 289.56 46.99 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a3ae88b-2ac9-4da8-b657-28a330a4e780")
	)
	(text "Lr: external inductor, total incl. T201 leakage = 54 uH.\nCr: polypropylene pulse type, >= 3 A rms at 100 kHz.\nR131 burden: OC trip at ~5 A primary peak (check UCC25600 OC thresholds)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 383.54 127 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4664923f-163d-43a6-8c89-f754f7b79bce")
	)
	(text "PFC control (UC3854B, average current mode, start values from TI app note U-134)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "80a28398-5e17-4a44-9aef-3ea90a14b1f3")
	)
	(text "CT 1n / RSET 15k: free-running ~83 kHz, synced to the LLC clock (95 kHz) via C162/D150 from U103 GD1.\nVSENSE 7.5 V: Vbus = 7.5 V x (R113+R114+R160+RV150)/(R160+RV150), RV150 sets 370...408 V. R113/R114/R150/R152: HV types (0.5 W, >= 500 V).\nVoltage loop: add Rvf/Cvf per U-134 once the loop is calculated. Pinout of the UC3854B symbol: verify against the data sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9504466a-cd91-428b-9a6c-831e7b2e3b78")
	)
	(text "LLC control (UCC25600, open loop = fixed frequency) and gate driver"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 143.51 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "472638c6-19ad-468e-b4b2-8c7a5b2b1ff4")
	)
	(text "R141 sets fs (~95 kHz, slightly below fr ~100 kHz), R142 the dead time (~200 ns):\ncheck the UCC25600 data sheet equations. SS sweeps from high frequency down to fs.\nU104A holds LLC_SS low until Vbus > 250 V. GD1 also syncs the PFC oscillator."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 325.12 236.22 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "88280f4c-c14b-43b4-96d3-cc76b29e4175")
	)
	(text "Startup and aux supply (VCC_PRI ~14 V)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9148d4bd-3173-4c24-a042-7d6be3a698e2")
	)
	(text "Q103 (depletion mode) starts the controllers from the bus;\nit turns off when W2 (aux) lifts VCC_PRI above ~12 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 309.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2b6e2bca-1042-42e4-8287-6fa5f4f55260")
	)
	(text "Bus OK (> 250 V): NTC bypass relay, LLC enable"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 262.89 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.778 1.778)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "bc8c7f2e-fd40-48d2-bc1a-3138a2323fa6")
	)
	(text "U104A: open collector holds LLC_SS low while the bus is low. U104B + Q180: relay K101 bypasses TH101\nonce the bus is charged. R185: hysteresis. R181/R182: HV types."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 340.36 0)
		(effects
